{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pack is for those who enjoy a luxurious lifestyle, but also appreciate the order. Expand your inventory and warehouse and get access to your stuff at any time. When everything you need is at hand, it's convenient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Quick Doe's Warehouse Bag</strong> (\u00d75)<br>Adds +10 slots to the character's warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Norin\u2019s Hyperbag</strong> (\u00d710)<br>Adds an additional cell to the inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Warehouse Ticket</strong> (\u00d720)<br>Allows you to open a warehouse when there are no Maidens nearby. Consumed when being used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All items are linked to the account and cannot be transferred or sold. After purchase, this DLC will appear in your Golden Chest on the character selection screen.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643120?t=1752064009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643120?t=1752064009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643120/06008df3fe489b6281659319446453a4c6a84c5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752064009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643120/06008df3fe489b6281659319446453a4c6a84c5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752064009","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pack is for those who enjoy a luxurious lifestyle, but also appreciate the order. Expand your inventory and warehouse and get access to your stuff at any time. When everything you need is at hand, it's convenient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Quick Doe's Warehouse Bag</strong> (\u00d75)<br>Adds +10 slots to the character's warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Norin\u2019s Hyperbag</strong> (\u00d710)<br>Adds an additional cell to the inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Warehouse Ticket</strong> (\u00d720)<br>Allows you to open a warehouse when there are no Maidens nearby. Consumed when being used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All items are linked to the account and cannot be transferred or sold. After purchase, this DLC will appear in your Golden Chest on the character selection screen.</strong></p>","developers":["BASE"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2962300","name":"Royal Quest Online"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643120/f94d0507c14a500590ccf73d3e5f7ce96f0e86b5/header.jpg?t=1752064009","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Royal Quest Online - Packmaster","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Royal Quest Online - Packmaster - $19.90 USD","packageid":1283994,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1990}],"title":"Buy Royal Quest Online - Packmaster"}],"packages":